# Ejemplos de la API v1 de Business. En Development usa FakeDataGateway (eventos semilla abajo).
@base = http://localhost:5002
@eventId = 01900000-0000-7000-8000-000000000001

### Salud (incluye el chequeo gRPC de Data)
GET {{base}}/health

### Listar eventos
GET {{base}}/api/v1/events

### Crear evento
POST {{base}}/api/v1/events
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Inundación Gramalote (ejemplo)", "type": "FLOOD", "startedAt": "2026-10-20T12:00:00Z", "description": "Datos de ejemplo" }

### Recibir una afectación (severidad derivada: 120 personas → HIGH)
# @name created
POST {{base}}/api/v1/impacts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "eventId": "{{eventId}}", "latitude": 1.1522, "longitude": -76.6466, "severity": null, "affectedPeople": 120,
  "municipality": "Mocoa", "department": "Putumayo", "description": "Vivienda afectada", "reportedAt": null, "source": "MANUAL" }

### Afectación inválida → 400 ValidationProblemDetails
POST {{base}}/api/v1/impacts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "eventId": "{{eventId}}", "latitude": 0, "longitude": 0, "affectedPeople": -1 }

### Detalle
GET {{base}}/api/v1/impacts/{{created.response.body.id}}

### Actualizar (REPORTED → VERIFIED)
PUT {{base}}/api/v1/impacts/{{created.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "eventId": "{{eventId}}", "latitude": 1.1522, "longitude": -76.6466, "affectedPeople": 120,
  "municipality": "Mocoa", "department": "Putumayo", "description": "Verificada en campo", "status": "VERIFIED" }

### Listar con filtros y paginación
GET {{base}}/api/v1/impacts?eventId={{eventId}}&minSeverity=HIGH&page=1&pageSize=50

### GeoJSON para el mapa (bbox de Putumayo)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/impacts/geojson?minLat=0&maxLat=2&minLon=-77.5&maxLon=-75.5

### Importar CSV (esperado 17 aceptadas / 3 rechazadas)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/impacts/import
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=b

--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="eventId"

{{eventId}}
--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="impacts-sample.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ../../contracts/samples/impacts-sample.csv
--b--

### Resumen por municipio
GET {{base}}/api/v1/stats/by-municipality?eventId={{eventId}}

### Borrado lógico
DELETE {{base}}/api/v1/impacts/{{created.response.body.id}}

### Sincronización de la app móvil (lote capturado sin conexión). Reenviarlo devuelve DUPLICATE.
POST {{base}}/api/v1/sync/batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "batchId": "{{$guid}}",
  "deviceId": "android-ejemplo",
  "items": [
    { "clientId": "{{$guid}}", "eventId": "{{eventId}}", "latitude": 1.1531, "longitude": -76.6481,
      "affectationLevel": 5, "affectedPeople": 40, "municipality": "Mocoa", "department": "Putumayo",
      "description": "Vivienda colapsada", "reportedAt": "2026-11-05T09:12:44Z" },
    { "clientId": "{{$guid}}", "eventId": "{{eventId}}", "latitude": 1.1490, "longitude": -76.6510,
      "affectationLevel": 2, "reportedAt": "2026-11-05T09:20:00Z" }
  ]
}

### Misma carga forzando la estrategia de la base de datos y paquetes de 1 registro
POST {{base}}/api/v1/sync/batch?strategy=DATABASE&chunkSize=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "batchId": "{{$guid}}",
  "deviceId": "android-ejemplo",
  "items": [
    { "clientId": "{{$guid}}", "eventId": "{{eventId}}", "latitude": 1.1555, "longitude": -76.6433,
      "affectationLevel": 3, "reportedAt": "2026-11-05T09:30:00Z" }
  ]
}
